          "accessed": "2026-11-11"
        }
      ]
    },
    "review_process": {
      "value": "专家审阅目标与领域假定、修订题目并检视三维证据；随后的质量审校接受标注或退回修改",
      "sources": [
        {
          "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.04087",
          "accessed": "2026-11-11"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://www.unipat.ai/blog/ScienceVision",
